WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 37cae67403778109e44f86b67a556520

00:00:00.456 --> 00:00:02.255
Haya, karibu kwenye video nyingine ya Uchambuzi wa Kina.

00:00:02.255 --> 00:00:04.695
Safari hii tunaangalia zoezi la Pengwini.

00:00:04.936 --> 00:00:09.375
Natumaini
ulitazama zoezi la Uso wa Mbweha, ambapo

00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:13.336
tulizungumza kidogo kuhusu ulinganifu, jambo
ambalo lingekusaidia katika zoezi hili kama

00:00:13.336 --> 00:00:17.655
uliitazama. Nadhani zoezi hili
halikuwa gumu sana, natumaini.

00:00:17.995 --> 00:00:22.295
Duaradufu ni za ajabu kidogo. Zinaweza
kuchukua muda kidogo kuzizoea.

00:00:22.716 --> 00:00:25.495
Lakini ukishazizoea,
ni rahisi kabisa.

00:00:26.126 --> 00:00:28.765
Lakini jambo kuu katika
zoezi hili ni kwamba nilitaka,

00:00:29.076 --> 00:00:34.765
ulitatue kwa kutumia mantiki tu, si kwa
kupima vitu, si kwa kubahatisha,

00:00:34.765 --> 00:00:38.125
kwa mantiki tu. Na kupanga programu
kunahusu mantiki kabisa.

00:00:38.765 --> 00:00:41.286
Na agizo moja nililokupa
lilikuwa

00:00:41.286 --> 00:00:44.125
kuanza zoezi kwa kubonyeza Endesha Msimbo.

00:00:44.286 --> 00:00:47.646
Na hicho ni kidokezo muhimu sana
kwako kwa ujumla.

00:00:47.646 --> 00:00:52.206
Inafaa kila mara kuanza zoezi kwa
kubonyeza Endesha Msimbo na kuona kinachotokea.

00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:55.185
Mara nyingi kuna hali ya mwanzo,
kuna kitu cha kuona,

00:00:55.506 --> 00:00:57.185
ni tabia nzuri tu kujijengea.

00:00:58.865 --> 00:01:02.506
Basi hebu tujenge vitu. Tunataka
kujenga bawa la kulia.

00:01:02.506 --> 00:01:05.426
Kwanza kabisa, tuelewe kinachotokea
na bawa la kushoto.

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:10.066
Na kama nilivyokuonyesha awali, kitelezi
kinasaidia sana hapa. Tukirudi

00:01:10.066 --> 00:01:16.146
nyuma hadi pale tulipo na bawa la kushoto tu,
tunaweza kufikiri kuhusu hii,

00:01:17.025 --> 00:01:18.786
duaradufu hii peke yake.

00:01:19.975 --> 00:01:25.256
Na tukichora bawa la kulia,
ni nini hasa tunataka kubadilisha?

00:01:26.775 --> 00:01:32.055
Hebu tunakili duaradufu zetu. Basi,
tunataka iwe na upana uleule,

00:01:32.775 --> 00:01:35.975
kwa hiyo nusukipenyo X kibaki vilevile,
yaani sehemu hii.

00:01:36.296 --> 00:01:39.975
Na tunataka iwe na urefu uleule,
kwa hiyo nusukipenyo Y kibaki vilevile.

00:01:40.695 --> 00:01:44.376
Na tunataka ianzie
mahali palepale kwa wima,

00:01:45.245 --> 00:01:48.046
kwa hiyo kitovu Y nacho
kibaki vilevile.

00:01:48.766 --> 00:01:53.646
Kwa hiyo kitu pekee kinachohitaji
kubadilika ni hii 28, ambayo ni,

00:01:54.135 --> 00:01:56.206
umbali wake kutoka kushoto.

00:01:57.325 --> 00:02:03.646
Kwa hiyo tunahitaji kufikiri jinsi ya kuisogeza
kutoka kitovu chake upande wa kushoto

00:02:03.805 --> 00:02:05.885
hadi kitovu chake upande wa kulia.

00:02:07.006 --> 00:02:12.205
Na kama umbali huu ni 28 kutoka sifuri,
tunachohitaji kusema ni, basi, 100

00:02:13.026 --> 00:02:16.066
kutoa 28 ni ngapi? Tunataka kuisogeza 28 ndani.

00:02:16.866 --> 00:02:19.825
Na natumaini unaweza kufanya hivyo kichwani.

00:02:19.906 --> 00:02:21.665
Lakini kuiweka kama,

00:02:23.156 --> 00:02:24.066
72

00:02:25.346 --> 00:02:26.786
inaonekana sawa kwangu.

00:02:27.665 --> 00:02:31.105
Unaweza pia kutumia kikokotoo
na kufanya hesabu hizi.

00:02:31.586 --> 00:02:33.906
Na sasa tuna mabawa yenye ulinganifu.

00:02:34.225 --> 00:02:36.145
Kisha tunaambiwa hapa chini, sawa.

00:02:36.145 --> 00:02:38.866
Jambo linalofuata, upande wa kulia
wa uso hauonekani sawa.

00:02:39.216 --> 00:02:41.616
Sawa. Na, hiyo ni kwa sababu bado
hatujachora upande wa kulia wa uso.

00:02:42.096 --> 00:02:44.015
Basi hebu tuchore upande wa kulia wa uso.

00:02:45.295 --> 00:02:49.056
Kwa hiyo, upande wa kulia wa uso, na
hebu tusonge mbele hatua kwa hatua kuendesha msimbo.

00:02:49.135 --> 00:02:51.536
Hebu tusonge mbele hadi tupate,

00:02:54.735 --> 00:02:58.575
upande wa kushoto wa uso. Upande wa kulia
wa uso ni sawa kabisa na awali.

00:02:58.895 --> 00:03:04.096
Upana uleule, urefu uleule,
mahali palepale kwenye mhimili wa wima.

00:03:04.175 --> 00:03:05.776
Ni hii moja tu inayobadilika.

00:03:06.556 --> 00:03:13.436
Na tukifikiri tena kuhusu vitovu,
kutoka sifuri hadi 41, ni 100 kutoa 41 tu,

00:03:13.915 --> 00:03:15.996
ambayo ni 59.

00:03:17.116 --> 00:03:20.795
Kwa hiyo sasa tuna sehemu ya kati
ya uso yenye ulinganifu mzuri.

00:03:22.156 --> 00:03:26.556
Sasa tunaambiwa kwamba jicho la kulia
halionekani sawa, kwa hiyo tunashuka

00:03:26.955 --> 00:03:31.355
hadi jicho la kulia. Na hili lina
mistari miwili kwa jicho la kulia

00:03:32.325 --> 00:03:34.605
na ni sawa kabisa. Haya ni maduara.

00:03:34.605 --> 00:03:37.846
Tunataka nusukipenyo kiwe vilevile
kwa sababu tunataka ukubwa uwe uleule.

00:03:37.846 --> 00:03:41.006
Na hebu turudi nyuma tuyachore haya.

00:03:41.006 --> 00:03:43.445
Kwa hiyo tunataka nusukipenyo kiwe vilevile.

00:03:43.445 --> 00:03:45.286
Duara moja kubwa na duara moja dogo.

00:03:45.445 --> 00:03:49.045
Tunataka mahali pawe
palepale kwenye mhimili wa Y,

00:03:49.045 --> 00:03:51.686
lakini tunataka kuyageuza kwenye mhimili wa X.

00:03:52.006 --> 00:03:58.885
Kwa hiyo 100 kutoa 42 ni 58
na 100 kutoa 43 ni 57.

00:03:59.406 --> 00:04:02.445
Tunafanya hivyo na tunapata
macho mazuri yaliyogeuzwa.

00:04:03.645 --> 00:04:08.605
Kisha tuna mguu wa kulia. Kwa hiyo tena,
weka msimbo wako nadhifu.

00:04:08.605 --> 00:04:10.925
Ongeza mguu wa kulia. Kanuni ileile.

00:04:11.165 --> 00:04:17.005
Tukiendesha na tunaona mguu huu wa kushoto
ukichorwa hapa, mguu wa kulia,

00:04:17.485 --> 00:04:20.925
upana uleule, pande zote mbili,
urefu uleule, umbali uleule,

00:04:21.326 --> 00:04:24.786
mguu wa kulia, 100 kutoa 40 ni 60. Na.

00:04:24.855 --> 00:04:26.696
Na mwishowe, pua si sawa.

00:04:27.016 --> 00:04:30.295
Na utaona kwamba tulisema
pua inapaswa kuwa na ulinganifu.

00:04:30.805 --> 00:04:34.456
Na mahali fulani katika maelekezo,
tunakuambia,

00:04:36.216 --> 00:04:39.136
ubadilishe viwianishi vya kati,
usiongeze pembetatu mpya.

00:04:39.136 --> 00:04:41.415
Baadhi ya watu hukwama hapo.

00:04:42.536 --> 00:04:47.336
Kwa hiyo tunajua kwamba kwa sasa hii iko
karibu na kitovu cha X,

00:04:47.735 --> 00:04:50.935
na tunataka kubadilisha hii. Kwa hiyo badala
ya kuwa pembetatu kama hii,

00:04:51.175 --> 00:04:54.855
inakuwa pembetatu kama hii. Kwa hiyo
badala ya kitovu hiki hapa,

00:04:55.206 --> 00:04:57.286
tunataka kusogeza nukta hii, huku.

00:04:57.766 --> 00:05:01.125
Kwa hiyo hii tena ni 46 tu kutoka kushoto.

00:05:01.365 --> 00:05:07.526
Tunataka 46 kutoka kulia,
yaani 100 kutoa 46, ambayo ni 54.

00:05:08.326 --> 00:05:12.805
Bonyeza Endesha Msimbo. Hongera,
tuna pengwini anayefanya kazi.

00:05:13.685 --> 00:05:15.925
Natumaini hivyo ndivyo ulivyolitatua pia.

00:05:16.005 --> 00:05:20.886
Natumaini. Hukubahatisha
vitu, bali ulitumia mantiki kidogo hiyo.

00:05:21.346 --> 00:05:25.846
Huenda wakati fulani ulijaribu
kufanya jambo la kimantiki pia,

00:05:26.185 --> 00:05:31.386
la kuandika 100 kutoa 54. Samahani,
100 kutoa 46.

00:05:31.466 --> 00:05:33.266
Hilo lingekuwa jambo
la busara kabisa

00:05:33.266 --> 00:05:36.505
kufanya. Ila kwa sababu bado
sijakufundisha hilo,

00:05:36.745 --> 00:05:39.346
kwa sasa limezimwa katika zoezi hili.

00:05:39.346 --> 00:05:40.505
Kwa kweli,

00:05:41.305 --> 00:05:43.225
hili pia limezimwa katika zoezi hili.

00:05:43.865 --> 00:05:47.105
Lakini kwa sasa, tunasema Jiki
hakuruhusu kutumia kujumlisha,

00:05:47.105 --> 00:05:51.065
kutoa au vitu kama hivyo, lakini
utaruhusiwa katika mazoezi yajayo.

00:05:51.065 --> 00:05:55.065
Lakini kwa sasa, nataka kukuhimiza
ufanye tu yale niliyokufundisha.

00:05:55.466 --> 00:05:58.985
Kwa hiyo inabidi ufanye hesabu
hizi kichwani badala yake.

00:05:59.225 --> 00:06:04.266
Na 100 kutoa 46 ni 54. Kwa hiyo tunafanya hivyo.

00:06:04.925 --> 00:06:09.026
Natumaini hilo lilikuwa rahisi vya kutosha.
Kama ulipata shida nalo,

00:06:09.026 --> 00:06:12.586
natumaini video hii imekuonyesha
jinsi ya kulifikiria.

00:06:12.846 --> 00:06:16.906
Jinsi ya kupunguza kasi na kulikabili
tatizo kwa mantiki zaidi kidogo.

00:06:17.225 --> 00:06:18.865
Tuonane katika uchambuzi wa kina unaofuata.

00:06:18.865 --> 00:06:19.625
Asante kwa kutazama.
